  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 116 - 92 ÷ 4 + 25 × 2 - 20 = 150\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 116 and 92\n\n116 - 92 ÷ 4 + 25 × 2 - 20 = 150 ⇒ 92 - 116 ÷ 4 + 25 × 2 - 20 = 150\n\n⇒ 92 - __**116 ÷ 4**__ + 25 × 2 - 20 = 150\n\n⇒ 92 - 29 + __**25 × 2**__ - 20 = 150\n\n⇒ __92 + 50__ - 20 - 29 = 150\n\n⇒ __142 - 20 - 29__ = 150\n\n⇒ 93 ≠ 150 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 25 and 20\n\n116 - 92 ÷ 4 + 25 × 2 - 20 = 150 ⇒ 116 - 92 ÷ 4 + 20 × 2 - 25 = 150\n\n⇒ 116 - __**92 ÷ 4**__ + 20 × 2 - 25 = 150\n\n⇒ 116 - 23 + __**20 × 2**__ - 25 = 150\n\n⇒ __116 + 40__ - 25 - 23 = 150\n\n⇒ __156 - 25 - 23__ = 150\n\n⇒ 108 ≠ 150 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 2 and 4\n\n116 - 92 ÷ 4 + 25 × 2 - 20 = 150 ⇒ 116 - 92 ÷ 2 + 25 × 4 - 20 = 150\n\n⇒ 116 - __**92 ÷ 2**__ + 25 × 4 - 20 = 150\n\n⇒ 116 - 46 + __**25 × 4**__ - 20 = 150\n\n⇒ __**116 + 100**__ - 20 - 46 = 150\n\n⇒ __**216 - 20 - 46**__ = 150\n\n**⇒ 150 = 150 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 20 and 92\n\n116 - 92 ÷ 4 + 25 × 2 - 20 = 150 ⇒ 116 - 20 ÷ 4 + 25 × 2 - 92 = 150\n\n⇒ 116 - __20 ÷ 4__ + 25 × 2 - 92 = 150\n\n⇒ 116 - 5 + __**25 × 2**__ - 92 = 150\n\n⇒ __116 + 50__ - 92 - 5 = 150\n\n⇒ __166 - 92 - 5__ = 150\n\n⇒ 69 ≠ 150 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
